**3. `_loadSessionInner` cache:**

```dart
stage('walk');
// gh-1734: warm-switch context reuse — fingerprint the file BEFORE and AFTER the open; when the file did not change during the open, the built context is memoized per (path, size, mtime) and reused verbatim on the next open of the same unchanged file.
final fpBefore = await _sessionFileFingerprint(metadata);
final cached = fpBefore == null ? null : _resumedContextCache.match(metadata.path, sizeBytes: fpBefore.sizeBytes, mtimeMs: fpBefore.mtimeMs);
